OL,3,GNEWSAHow darts fans are a bullseye for
OL,4,AWolverhampton's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is that time of year again when
OL,7,Fthousands of darts fans flock to
OL,8,FWolverhampton for one of the sport's
OL,9,Fbiggest tournaments.
OL,11,FThe Grand Slam of Darts returns to WV
OL,12,FActive Aldersley on Saturday, with big
OL,13,Fnames such as world number Luke Littler
OL,14,Fand Women's World Matchplay champion
OL,15,FBeau Greaves expected to step up to the
OL,16,Foche.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
