OL,3,GNEWSAHow darts fans are a bullseye for
OL,4,AWolverhampton's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe competition has been staged at the
OL,7,Fvenue every year since 2018, with the
OL,8,Fexception of 2020, and has become
OL,9,Frenowned not only for world-class darts
OL,10,Fbut also for colourful fancy dress
OL,11,Fcostumes worn by supporters.
OL,13,FBut what does the tournament mean for
OL,14,FWolverhampton, and how do local
OL,15,Fbusinesses prepare for the influx of
OL,16,Fvisitors?
